{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured DNSSEC-signed authoritative DNS for infra.test with node1 primary, node2/node3 secondaries, and node4 resolving through both secondaries. Authenticated updates, propagation, failover, cleanup, and restart persistence were verified.","actions_performed":["Installed and enabled BIND on all four nodes.","Configured automatic DNSSEC signing and TSIG-authenticated updates on node1.","Configured authenticated transfers and notifications to node2 and node3.","Configured node4 with both secondaries as forwarders.","Published app.infra.test as 10.100.205.10 and status.infra.test as \"ready\".","Demonstrated resolution while node2 was unavailable, then restored it.","Restarted every node sequentially and verified changed boot identities and recovery.","Removed temporary verification records; final zone serial is 2026100107."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Signed authoritative zone and requested records","command_ids":["cmd-8921e4b066464308","cmd-4408a7ef5d724210"],"summary":"All three authoritative servers return matching serial 2026100107, app=10.100.205.10, status=\"ready\", and A/RRSIG answers."},{"requirement":"Authenticated updates from node1 and propagation","command_ids":["cmd-3a3e6bf15a004d52","cmd-2e9360feede449fb","cmd-76db2a00798b48ac","cmd-c849a600ea65426c"],"summary":"Unauthenticated updates were refused; TSIG updates succeeded and propagated to both secondaries, including after restarts."},{"requirement":"node4 resolves through both secondaries with failover","command_ids":["cmd-4f71a79657e04af0","cmd-f9779c8e87444c8d","cmd-8ca3bb7dd4104f0f","cmd-4e5a2d593c444b34","cmd-4408a7ef5d724210"],"summary":"Both forwarders are configured. With node2 stopped and caches flushed, node4 resolved through node3; node2 subsequently recovered."},{"requirement":"Temporary verification data removed","command_ids":["cmd-c8b030a45e7245bd","cmd-4408a7ef5d724210"],"summary":"Verification records were deleted by authenticated update and are absent from all authorities."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-d33f755ce81d45f5","cmd-9284da8c4b5547db","cmd-c6ee6e35885c4453"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and restart acknowledgement captured; boot ID changed and primary service, serial, records, updates, and signatures recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-31ff717b51c24fad","cmd-1b872e7cd72e4099","cmd-5726d990add34af3","cmd-3ac9b41f581a4b42"],"summary":"Boot ID changed; the secondary recovered active service, current serial, transferred data, and signed answers."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-33beade663e94bc0","cmd-f35251db08c144b0","cmd-c61a2af90da34d14","cmd-22fd9ae60eef49ae"],"summary":"Boot ID changed; the secondary recovered active service, current serial, transferred data, and signed answers."},{"requirement":"node4 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-4f71a79657e04af0","cmd-cd4558e11d004ff8","cmd-0f6fe9cc12714089","cmd-717eed79a98d4e29"],"summary":"Boot ID changed; BIND, both forwarders, system resolver configuration, and DNS resolution recovered."}]}
